To use this function, you'll need to include the libcppmarkdown library in your project. You can install it using a package manager like `apt-get` on Ubuntu or `brew` on macOS.

Note that this function assumes that the markdown text is well-formed and follows the markdown specification. If the markdown text is not well-formed, you may need to add error handling and syntax checking to the function.

